commit 42df20431e343d4cae5c18ed1dcc58d4c8bdcb48
Author: ledger <ledger@example.invalid>
Date:   Mon Nov 23 02:01:23 2026 +0000

    Add a committee tasks board
    
    Built from incoming/tasks.csv, as decided at the 12 Nov meeting. Open tasks are
    grouped as overdue / due by this Thursday / due by next Thursday / later, so the
    meeting starts with what's due. Done tasks fold away at the bottom. Unowned tasks
    show 'nobody yet'. The polytunnel rota from the sheet's side columns is shown
    at the top (Dot's request).
    
    Kit: board.json can now group by due date (section.due), show a rota, format
    dates, and add a prefix to a column. Status is matched case-insensitively
    because the sheet has both 'done' and 'Done'. The events board is unchanged
    (byte-identical when built for the same date).
    
    Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>

